{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a7b8c9d0-1122-4455-8899-snakearena2026",
    "name": "Snake Arena: Clash of Serpents (ABL Microservices)",
    "description": "Koleksi Postman siap pakai untuk mendemonstrasikan seluruh kontrak REST API v1.0, transisi breaking change v2.0, komunikasi antar-layanan + Resilience4j Circuit Breaker, dan healthcheck Spring Boot Actuator.\n\nUrutan Demo Cepat (Collection Runner atau klik urut):\n1. Healthcheck Player (:8081) & Arena (:8082)\n2. Player v1 CRUD (POST, GET, PUT, PATCH)\n3. Player v2 Breaking Change Negative Test (400 Bad Request) & v2 CRUD + Cross-Version Read\n4. Arena Session Flow (Join, State 30x30, Loadout, Direction, Eat, Skill, Heartbeat, Delete -> Score Sync)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "player_url", "value": "http://localhost:8081", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "arena_url", "value": "http://localhost:8082", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "player_id_v1", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "player_id_v2", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "demo_player_name", "value": "ViperDemo", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "snake_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
